,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows April to May came in under 90% of normal in 33 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, May to June ran 153% of normal and July to August ran 74% on that same middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1964, with grids 26924 and 27224 at 65% of normal in 1964.</p>"}
